  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 50eb (Costly) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (5 minutes): intense hallucinations distort reality and lower inhibitions; the GM may say you're spinning out and lose your Action. Your EMP counts as 2 higher (maximum 8) for Humanity and its effects only (not skill checks), which can hold off cyberpsychosis while it lasts. Secondary (DV19): take 3 Humanity Loss; addiction. While addicted: REF -2.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"RPM Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
